    "body": "I am leery of using this particular instance as the gateway to changing from normal English phrases as algorithm names, to ES-style PascalCaseAbstractOps. The web spec space has gotten along great with English phrases until now and I'm not sure how I feel about breaking that tradition so suddenly. But I don't care much so don't let me stop you.\n",
